      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND SENATOR.\nSo did we woo\nTransformed Timon to our city’s love\nBy humble message and by promised means.\nWe were not all unkind, nor all deserve\nThe common stroke of war.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
