      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST SENATOR.\nSet but thy foot\nAgainst our rampired gates and they shall ope,\nSo thou wilt send thy gentle heart before\nTo say thou’lt enter friendly.",
