      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SECOND SENATOR.\nThrow thy glove,\nOr any token of thine honour else,\nThat thou wilt use the wars as thy redress\nAnd not as our confusion, all thy powers\nShall make their harbour in our town till we\nHave sealed thy full desire.",
